mkff-opus
=========

This crate is a Rust implementation of the Opus decoder written for MKFF from RFC 6716
(Definition of the Opus Audio Codec), RFC 8251 (Updates to the Opus Audio Codec) and RFC 7845
(Ogg Encapsulation for the Opus Audio Codec).

RFC 6716 includes the normative reference implementation of Opus as source code (Appendix A,
"opus-rfc6716.tar.gz", SHA-1 86a927223e73d2476646a1b933fcd3fffb6ecc8c). Large parts of this
crate are close ports of that reference code, with the RFC 8251 patches applied:

- src/range.rs           ec_dec (celt/entdec.c, celt/entcode.c)
- src/celt/rate.rs       celt/rate.c (bit allocation, pulse cache helpers)
- src/celt/bands.rs      celt/bands.c, celt/vq.c (band decoding, PVQ, spreading, folding,
                         anti-collapse); the PVQ codeword enumeration follows RFC 6716 §4.3.4.2
- src/celt/mod.rs        celt/celt.c (decoder), celt/quant_bands.c, celt/laplace.c,
                         celt/mdct.c (inverse MDCT structure)
- src/celt/plc.rs        celt/pitch.c, celt/celt_lpc.c (loss concealment)
- src/silk/mod.rs        silk/dec_API.c, decode_frame.c, decode_indices.c, decode_pulses.c,
                         shell_coder.c, code_signs.c, decode_parameters.c, decode_pitch.c,
                         gain_quant.c, NLSF_decode.c, NLSF_unpack.c, NLSF_stabilize.c,
                         NLSF_VQ_weights_laroia.c, NLSF2A.c, LPC_inv_pred_gain.c,
                         bwexpander*.c, LPC_analysis_filter.c, decode_core.c,
                         stereo_decode_pred.c, stereo_MS_to_LR.c, decoder_set_fs.c, PLC.c,
                         sum_sqr_shift.c, log2lin.c, Inlines.h, resampler.c,
                         resampler_private_IIR_FIR.c, resampler_private_up2_HQ.c
- src/stream.rs          src/opus_decoder.c (mode transitions, redundancy)
- src/packet.rs          src/opus.c / opus_decoder.c packet parsing (RFC 6716 §3)
- src/lib.rs             src/opus_multistream.c (stream / channel mapping)
- src/celt/tables.rs,    tables extracted mechanically from celt/modes.c,
  src/silk/tables.rs     celt/static_modes_float.h, celt/quant_bands.c and silk/tables_*.c,
                         silk/pitch_est_tables.c, silk/table_LSF_cos.c, silk/resampler_rom.c

